{"parentUuid":"67f1b734-ceca-43b0-aa17-53be3bae8d6b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01WwVVYfN9VfZksLhzntbdND","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done — the full gh-dash dashboard is built into entire-brain and verified end-to-end. I've **stopped short of committing** so you can review first.\n\n## What shipped: `entire brain dash`\n\nA new pure `internal/tui` package (ported from entire-judge's, adapted to the brain) + a new `internal/cli/dash.go` command, wired into the **Explore** group.\n\n- **Combined dashboard**: a **Home** tab (source health with ●/○ dots, freshness, working-tree state, blind spots, warnings) + explorer tabs **Facts · Sessions · History · Semantic**, each a filterable list → rich detail page.\n- **Deterministic & no-egress**: every page formats data the brain already stores — zero agent calls, read-only.\n- **Full gh-dash treatment**: two bordered panes, tab bar, 4 themes (`--theme` / `ENTIRE_BRAIN_THEME`), `/` filter, `?` help, vim+arrow+mouse nav, viewport scroll, runewidth-safe truncation, and `o` to open an entry's source (code `file:line` or transcript) via the OS opener.\n- **Reuses existing loaders** — `buildBrainStatusReport`, `loadFacts`, `loadBrainHistoryIndex`, the semantic snapshot scanner — so no parsing was reinvented.\n- **No silent truncation**: large tabs are capped (`--limit`, default 500) with a visible \"showing N of M\" note.\n- Non-TTY → `--plain` summary; `--json` emits the snapshot.\n\n## Verification (all green)\n- `go build`, `go vet`, `go test ./...`, and `-race` on the new packages.\n- **Live against this repo's real brain**: rendered Home correctly (2843 symbols, 68923 history records — caps applied + noted; Facts absent on this branch shown cleanly). The static layout snapshot above looks right.\n- No person names anywhere in code/help/tests (checked).\n\n## State & what's next\nOn branch `claude/brain-dash-tui`. Changeset:\n- **New**: `internal/tui/` (styles, keys, viewmodels, table, detail, tui, tui_test) + `internal/cli/dash.go` + `dash_test.go`\n- **Modified**: `go.mod`, `go.sum`, `internal/cli/root.go` (one registration line)\n\n⚠️ The untracked `.regente/ .cursor/ .gemini/ .mcp.json .claude/skills/ .codex/skills/` are local tooling scaffolding — **not part of this feature**; I'll gitignore them rather than commit them.\n\nPer your review-before-push rule, I've left everything uncommitted. Want me to commit (code only, tooling gitignored) and show you the message — or would you like to review the diff first?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1389,"cache_read_input_tokens":282543,"output_tokens":1579,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1389,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1579,"cache_read_input_tokens":282543,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1389},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cc7ySSeJf3jMTbGXRMRFj","attributionSkill":"superpowers:brainstorming","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"88d73a62-ea6e-4b9d-b1c3-a2f7af02fb6f","timestamp":"2026-06-17T01:36:06.008Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/brain-dash-tui","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
