{"parentUuid":"075ef66c-bcd2-4d9c-9ec1-95c6833945be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_013VNAJfXFeYothsFx7JBgrn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Audit complete and all confirmed bugs fixed. The workflow raised **16 findings; 4 survived adversarial verification** (the other 12 were rejected as speculative/stylistic). All 4 are now fixed and regression-tested:\n\n| # | Severity | Bug | Fix |\n|---|----------|-----|-----|\n| 1 | **crash** | `switchTab` swapped columns before rows → `SetColumns` re-rendered stale wider rows against narrower columns → panic cycling into a narrower tab (e.g. Sessions→History). This is the **main nav gesture** — I genuinely missed it. | Clear rows before swapping columns (`SetRows(nil)`) + `TestTabCycleNoPanic` (cycles all tabs both ways) |\n| 2 | **bug** | Home \"Sources\" block garbled on any **color terminal**: an already-styled line was fed to the ANSI-unaware `runewidth.Truncate`, which counted escape bytes and ate the visible text. Masked by tests running in ASCII. | Use lipgloss `MaxWidth` (ANSI-aware) + `TestRenderHomeSurvivesColorProfile` (runs under ANSI256) |\n| 3 | **security** | `o` could open files **outside the brain** via `../` in anchor paths read raw from brain files (`brainRelPath` only blocked absolute paths). | Added `filepath.Rel` containment guard + `TestBrainRelPathRejectsTraversal` |\n| 4 | **minor** | `osc8`/`linkStyle`/`Theme.Link` were dead code; `writeOpenHint` printed a static string, so `TestHyperlinkIsZeroWidth` guarded nothing. | Wired the OSC 8 clickable link into `writeOpenHint` (matches the plan) + `TestDetailRendersSourceLink` |\n\n**Verification:** `go build`, `go vet`, full `go test ./...`, and `-race` on the new packages — all green. Live smoke (`dash --plain`) still works.\n\nThe crash (#1) is the important catch — without the audit, anyone with a populated brain would have hit it within seconds of pressing `tab`. Worth running the dashboard yourself now (the rebuilt binary at `/tmp/entire-brain` has all fixes): `cd` into the repo and run `/tmp/entire-brain dash`, then cycle tabs freely.\n\nStill all uncommitted on `claude/brain-dash-tui`, per your review-before-push rule. Want me to commit now (code only, tooling dirs gitignored) and show you the message?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":638,"cache_read_input_tokens":321958,"output_tokens":1265,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":638,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1265,"cache_read_input_tokens":321958,"cache_creation_input_tokens":638,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":638},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cc87qN829M6cR2WAAHjFj","type":"assistant","uuid":"8754819b-0b02-44eb-bbf3-e6b1a1889675","timestamp":"2026-06-17T03:26:07.297Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/brain-dash-tui","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
