{"parentUuid":"2152e40e-6276-4852-ada9-9c8720040700","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9c074a52-18bf-48cc-a66f-4cfb35104267","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bs8FqccwqbfoeHVdJPjeSr","type":"tool_result","content":"BUILD OK\nVET OK\n=== add help ===\nadd readies a repository for exploration without a manual clone: it clones the\nrepository, fetches its Entire checkpoint history (refs/heads/entire/*), and\nbuilds the brain by running `refresh` against the clone. Afterward explore it\nwith `entire brain dash`, `status`, or `search` from inside the clone.\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain add <repo-url> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --build                  Build the brain after cloning (use --build=false to clone only) (default true)\n      --checkpoint-limit int   Limit checkpoints scanned when building the brain (0 = refresh default)\n      --dir string             Directory to clone the repository into (default \".\")\n  -h, --help                   help for add","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"587e6126-cb5d-467f-a3fb-8cb9f514f58b","timestamp":"2026-06-17T03:37:00.941Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"BUILD OK\nVET OK\n=== add help ===\nadd readies a repository for exploration without a manual clone: it clones the\nrepository, fetches its Entire checkpoint history (refs/heads/entire/*), and\nbuilds the brain by running `refresh` against the clone. Afterward explore it\nwith `entire brain dash`, `status`, or `search` from inside the clone.\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain add <repo-url> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --build                  Build the brain after cloning (use --build=false to clone only) (default true)\n      --checkpoint-limit int   Limit checkpoints scanned when building the brain (0 = refresh default)\n      --dir string             Directory to clone the repository into (default \".\")\n  -h, --help                   help for add","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2152e40e-627