{"parentUuid":"81b4f81e-4162-43ad-a041-d99610ba38e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01DrvMRtANpwdPJeM2ggXuxH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Evmv4zqzQxLKzkXrZ8ruNV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain\ngh pr create --base main --head claude/brain-dash-tui \\\n  --title \"Interactive brain dashboard TUI (\\`entire brain dash\\`) with search and \\`add\\`\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## What this adds\n\nA gh-dash-style two-pane terminal dashboard for exploring a built brain, plus a clone-and-build convenience command.\n\n### `entire brain dash`\n- **Combined view**: a **Home** tab (per-source health, freshness, blind spots, working-tree state) plus explorer tabs — **Facts · Sessions · History · Semantic** — each a filterable list with a per-entry detail page.\n- **Search** (`s`): runs the same retrieval as `entire brain search` (lexical over facts/history/docs) from inside the dashboard, results on a dedicated Search tab. Runs async so the UI never blocks.\n- Polish: 4 themes (`--theme` / `ENTIRE_BRAIN_THEME`), `/` filter, `?` help, vim+arrow+mouse nav, viewport scroll, OSC 8 source links + `o` to open an entry's source.\n- **Read-only and no-egress** — it only formats data the brain already stores; no agent calls. Non-TTY falls back to `--plain`; `--json` emits the snapshot.\n\n### `entire brain add <repo-url>`\nClones a repo, fetches its Entire history, and builds the brain via `refresh` — no manual clone needed.\n\n## Implementation\n- `internal/tui`: new pure rendering package (no file IO of its own); the cli layer assembles a snapshot from existing loaders (`buildBrainStatusReport`, `loadFacts`, `loadBrainHistoryIndex`, the semantic snapshot scanner) and hands it in.\n- `internal/cli/dash.go`, `internal/cli/add.go`; registered in `root.go`.\n\n## Testing\n- `go build`, `go vet`, full `go test ./...`, and `-race` on the new packages — all green.\n- Unit tests cover row/detail builders, theme/tab parsing, the async search flow, full tab cycling, path containment, and the `add` URL guards.\n- Two adversarial multi-agent audits were run over the new code; all confirmed findings (a tab-cycle panic, ANSI-aware truncation, `../` containment in open targets, a stale-filter/search interaction, and `add` URL hardening) are fixed and regression-tested.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -5","description":"Open the entire-brain PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1550,"cache_read_input_tokens":461740,"output_tokens":1277,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1550,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1277,"cache_read_input_tokens":461740,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1550,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1550},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cc8ycprpJGt1rgA8hhWKY","type":"assistant","uuid":"692e4244-2c8e-4541-ae7d-a30c605515f0","timestamp":"2026-06-17T14:18:56.978Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/brain-dash-tui","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
